  "statement": "theorem ftlPredict_bestRegret_initial_correction (initial : ℝ) (y : ℕ → ℝ) (T : ℕ) (hT : 0 < T) : squaredBestRegret y (ftlPredict initial y) T = squaredBestRegret y (meanPredict y) T + ((initial - y 0)^2 - ((1 : ℝ) / 2 - y 0)^2)",
